// edit batch -> synchronous commit on THAT thread, R32) while the main thread
// renders Storm frames through the imaging engine concurrently and, per
// frame, reads the UsdGenImagingTestHook published-generation stamp:
//   - the published generation is monotonically non-decreasing across every
